      { title: 'Short-cycling and odd behavior', text: 'A unit that fires, shuts down and fires again within seconds, often with a thump from the burner — demand below the minimum activation flow, a mixing valve bleeding cold into the hot line, scale restricting flow, or a flow sensor reporting noise rather than real movement.' },
    ]}
